  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In aqueous solution basicity order of $1^{\\circ}, 2^{\\circ}$ and $3^{\\circ}$ amine with methyl group is \n$2^{\\circ}>1^{\\circ}>3^{\\circ}$\nIn case of aniline lone pair of nitrogen is involved in resonance, so it is weaker base than aliphatic amines.\nHence, (C) is correct.",
    "image": null
  },
